(function(root){'use strict';const BundleNumber={normalize(value){return String(value??'').trim().toUpperCase().replace(/^MUS-(\d{4})-(\d{1,3})-(\d+)$/,(_,y,d,n)=>'MUS-'+y+'-'+d.padStart(3,'0')+'-'+n);},batch(value){const n=this.normalize(value);return /^MUS-\d{4}-\d{3}-\d{2,}$/.test(n)&&/[1-9]/.test(n.split('-')[3])?n.split('-').slice(0,3).join('-'):'';}};if(typeof module==='object'&&module.exports)module.exports=BundleNumber;else root.BundleNumber=BundleNumber;})(typeof window==='object'?window:globalThis);
